				""
				"Place the &aSellable Items&r in the &6Left slot&r and wait for them to be delivered, one batch at a time.  They take a while to deliver the batches"
				""
				"Typing &a#sellables&r in the &6Inventory Search Bar&r will show all the things that can be sold in the &bSelling Bins"
